SUMMARY:GFL ENVIRONMENTAL HOLDINGS US INC — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: GFL ENVIRONMENTAL HOLDINGS US INC\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadsh
 ow.com/events/login/1PeTHmojK3uiZiyrZmBFmHwP8VbM6URauxbeB\n\nDeal context:
 \nGFL Environmental Holdings (US)\, Inc.\, a wholly-owned subsidiary of GF
 L Environmental Inc.\, is bringing a $750 million 5-year Senior Unsecured 
 Notes offering to market via a 144A/Reg S format\, with Barclays acting as
  Lead Left bookrunner. The deal is rated Ba3/BB (High Yield)\, features a 
 NC2 structure with a 40% equity clawback during the first year\, and proce
 eds will be used to repay existing revolving credit facility drawings and 
 fund fees & expenses related to the SECURE Transaction\, with the offering
  designed to increase GFL's available liquidity for its growth strategy. T
 he investor call is scheduled for June 22nd at 11:00 AM ET with pricing ex
 pected the same afternoon.
